---
import LegalLayout from "~/layouts/LegalLayout.astro";
import { SITE } from "~/lib/site";
const updated = "July 29, 2026";
---

<LegalLayout
  title="Disclaimer — CartConsent"
  description="Important disclaimers about the CartConsent plugin, service, and any compliance-related statements on this site."
  heading="Disclaimer"
  updated={updated}
>
  <h2>No legal advice</h2>
  <p>
    {SITE.name} provides software and tools to help you run cart recovery and manage consent. Nothing
    on this website, in the plugin, or in the generated legal documents is legal advice. Installing a
    plugin does not by itself make your website or your marketing compliant. Whether your specific
    configuration and sends are lawful depends on your business and jurisdiction — consult your own
    attorney.
  </p>

  <h2>"As is" software</h2>
  <p>
    The plugin and Service are provided "as is" and "as available," without warranties of any kind,
    express or implied, including merchantability, fitness for a particular purpose, and
    non-infringement. You are responsible for testing and for how you use the Service.
  </p>

  <h2>Compliance features</h2>
  <p>
    Features such as consent recording, Global Privacy Control honoring, script blocking, and
    auto-updating documents are designed to help you meet common requirements, but they do not
    guarantee compliance with any specific law or the practices of any regulator or platform.
  </p>

  <h2>Results</h2>
  <p>
    Any figures shown on this site (for example, recovery rates or recovered revenue) are
    illustrative. Your results will vary based on your traffic, products, pricing, and how you
    configure the Service.
  </p>

  <h2>Third parties</h2>
  <p>
    References to third-party products (such as WooCommerce, Termageddon, or other plugins) are for
    identification only and do not imply endorsement. Their trademarks belong to their owners.
  </p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>Questions? Email <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a>.</p>
</LegalLayout>
